    "id": "art_caged-scale-g-form",
    "slug": "caged-scale-g-form",
    "title": "The G Form: A Fret Below Every Root",
    "summary": "The G form's three roots each have a 7 sitting one fret beneath them on the same string — the clearest demonstration in the chapter of what a leaning note actually sounds like.",
    "tags": ["caged", "fretboard"],
    "readingTimeMin": 4,
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-11"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every root in the G form has a leaning note sitting one fret beneath it, on the same string, and this window is the clearest place in the whole chapter to hear what that means, because it happens three separate times. The G form of "
        },
        { "text": "C", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " sits with its barre at fret " },
        { "text": "5", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", spanning frets " },
        { "text": "4–8", "marks": ["code"] },
        {
          "text": ". It now carries seventeen dots — the major scale, complete, inside the same window chapter 1 first showed you three roots in. String "
        },
        { "text": "4", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " is the only string here holding just two, at " },
        { "text": "4·5", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " and " },
        { "text": "4·7", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": "; every other string holds three." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        [{ "text": "String" }],
        [{ "text": "Dot 1" }],
        [{ "text": "Dot 2" }],
        [{ "text": "Dot 3" }]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [{ "text": "6" }],
          [{ "text": "6·5 — 6, A", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "6·7 — 7, B", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "6·8 — 1, C", "marks": ["code"] }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "5" }],
          [{ "text": "5·5 — 2, D", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "5·7 — 3, E", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "5·8 — 4, F", "marks": ["code"] }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "4" }],
          [{ "text": "4·5 — 5, G", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "4·7 — 6, A", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "—" }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "3" }],
          [{ "text": "3·4 — 7, B", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "3·5 — 1, C", "marks": ["code"] }],
          [{ "text": "3·7 — 2, D", "marks": ["code"] }]
        ],
        [
          [{ "text": "2" }],
